    {
      "id": "boy1",
      "name": "小满",
      "position": {
        "x": 600,
        "y": -220
      },
      "commands": [
        {
          "id": "c0034",
          "type": "bg",
          "background": {
            "kind": "image",
            "assetId": "bg_near_boy"
          },
          "transition": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0035",
          "type": "hide",
          "characterId": "boy"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0036",
          "type": "hide",
          "characterId": "post"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0037",
          "type": "hide",
          "characterId": "girl"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0038",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "五点四十分。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0039",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "小满的帆布包里还剩十二份晚报。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0040",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "娘说，路灯亮之前要回家。路灯已经亮了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0041",
          "type": "say",
          "characterId": "buyer",
          "text": "小孩，今天有什么新闻？"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0042",
          "type": "say",
          "characterId": "boy",
          "text": "都一样。一毛钱一份。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0043",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "那人笑了，给了他两毛，说不用找了。小满把钱捏在手心里，捏出了汗。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0044",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "还剩十一份。卖完它们，够给娘抓两服药。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0045",
          "type": "if",
          "condition": {
            "kind": "compare",
            "variableId": "letterGiven",
            "op": "==",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "c0046",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "街对面，那个邮递员把车停在钟底下，递给一个姑娘一封信。小满想：谁会在大街上收信呢？"
            }
          ],
          "else": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c0047",
          "type": "if",
          "condition": {
            "kind": "compare",
            "variableId": "girlLeft",
            "op": "==",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "c0048",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "钟底下那个穿长大衣的姑娘刚刚走了。她走得很快，好像什么都没看见。"
            }
          ],
          "else": []
        },
        {
          "id": "c0049",
          "type": "say",
          "text": "天越来越暗。风把报纸的一角掀起来，啪啪地响。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0050",
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "c0051",
              "text": "再卖一会儿，还剩十一份。",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "variableId": "boyStayed",
                  "op": "set",
                  "value": true
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "c0052",
              "text": "回家，娘在等。",
              "effects": [
                {
                  "variableId": "boyStayed",
                  "op": "set",
                  "value": false
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "prompt": "路灯已经亮了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c0053",
          "type": "if",
          "condition": {
            "kind": "compare",
            "variableId": "boyStayed",
            "op": "==",
            "value": true
          },
          "then": [
            {
              "id": "c0054",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "他把一份报纸高高地举过头顶，朝着下班的人群喊："
            },
            {
              "id": "c0055",
              "type": "say",
              "characterId": "boy",
              "text": "晚报——晚报——"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0056",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "照片上，他的嘴张着。他喊的是什么，看照片的人谁也听不见。"
            }
          ],
          "else": [
            {
              "id": "c0057",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "他背起包就跑。跑过街口的时候，一份报纸从包里滑出来，落在湿漉漉的地上。"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0058",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "他没有回头。那天晚上，娘问他今天卖得好不好，他说好。"
            },
            {
              "id": "c0059",
              "type": "say",
              "text": "照片上，他站过的地方只剩下那一份报纸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c0060",
          "type": "setVar",
          "effect": {
            "variableId": "seenBoy",
            "op": "set",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "c0061",
          "type": "jump",
          "targetSceneId": "photo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "post1",
